WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.235 --> 00:00:17.558
next morning Wugg and Dara packed two small bags.

2
00:00:17.578 --> 00:00:21.781
"Are you sure you'll be okay staying here in Stone Wall without us?"

3
00:00:22.361 --> 00:00:22.981
Wugg asked.

4
00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:25.863
"Yes." Loro smiled.

5
00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:28.705
"Bring me a gift from First City, okay?

6
00:00:29.526 --> 00:00:32.488
Maybe one of those zap accelerators I was telling you about."

7
00:00:33.228 --> 00:00:34.069
Dara chuckled.

8
00:00:34.089 --> 00:00:37.591
"We'll be sure to look for one.

9
00:00:38.332 --> 00:00:39.873
They sound very useful."

10
00:00:40.713 --> 00:00:42.574
"Right," Wugg added with a wink.

11
00:00:42.594 --> 00:00:47.858
"Your new friends are already teaching you interesting things, aren't they?

12
00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.460
Good luck, and we'll see you in a few days!"

13
00:00:51.781 --> 00:00:52.721
They zapped away.

14
00:00:53.702 --> 00:00:56.123
It was very early, and the village was quiet.

15
00:00:56.804 --> 00:00:59.806
Loro thought about trying to zap to the cave on his own.

16
00:01:00.546 --> 00:01:02.568
But he was still very new to this area.

17
00:01:03.148 --> 00:01:05.610
He didn't want to accidentally land in the wrong spot.

18
00:01:06.151 --> 00:01:08.212
So he set off across the village on foot.

19
00:01:08.873 --> 00:01:13.016
Panno was sitting on the same bench where the kids had encountered him the previous day.

20
00:01:13.917 --> 00:01:17.300
Loro noticed Panno staring at him with an odd expression.

21
00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:20.362
"Good morning," Loro said politely.

22
00:01:21.483 --> 00:01:26.787
Panno grunted a greeting, but his expression remained strange, almost threatening.

23
00:01:26.807 --> 00:01:32.572
"I get the sense that Panno thinks I don't belong here," Loro thought.

24
00:01:33.568 --> 00:01:35.509
He hurried on, feeling uncomfortable.

25
00:01:35.529 --> 00:01:39.851
"I hope he doesn't know that I—" "Hey, Loro!"

26
00:01:40.352 --> 00:01:42.453
Zella's voice interrupted Loro's thoughts.

27
00:01:43.313 --> 00:01:45.995
She and Raff were sitting in the yard outside their house.

28
00:01:46.775 --> 00:01:49.497
They were eating breakfast at a little table beneath a tree.

29
00:01:49.517 --> 00:01:51.798
"Are you on your way to the cave?"

30
00:01:52.198 --> 00:01:52.818
Raff asked.

31
00:01:52.838 --> 00:01:56.320
"You seem even more eager to get there than Zella is!"

32
00:01:57.681 --> 00:01:58.421
Zella laughed.

33
00:01:58.441 --> 00:02:02.964
"Yeah, especially since you couldn't wait to get out of there yesterday!"

34
00:02:03.924 --> 00:02:05.404
Loro smiled sheepishly.

35
00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:10.746
"I got excited about exploring the cave while I was telling my parents about it.

36
00:02:11.446 --> 00:02:16.547
Besides, I wanted to get away before they gave me a bunch of chores around our new house."

37
00:02:16.567 --> 00:02:19.768
"We're almost finished eating," Raff said.

38
00:02:19.788 --> 00:02:22.569
"We can head out to the cave in a few minutes."

39
00:02:23.949 --> 00:02:26.810
Loro had hoped to look around the cave by himself first.

40
00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.291
But he figured it wasn't a big deal.

41
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:32.071
It was important to make friends here.

42
00:02:32.092 --> 00:02:33.692
"Where's Muncher?"

43
00:02:34.004 --> 00:02:37.827
he asked as the siblings gulped down the rest of their puckerberry pancakes.

44
00:02:37.847 --> 00:02:40.568
"Our dad loaned him to a neighbor for the day."

45
00:02:41.289 --> 00:02:43.050
Raff pointed to a fence nearby.

46
00:02:43.711 --> 00:02:45.232
Muncher was on the other side of it.

47
00:02:45.692 --> 00:02:49.334
The donkey's nose was buried in a patch of brightly colored flowers.

48
00:02:49.354 --> 00:02:55.618
"As you can see, the neighbor has a bunch of sprinkle thistles growing in her yard," Raff said.

49
00:02:55.638 --> 00:03:00.101
"That's why she asked to borrow him—she wants Muncher to eat them all up."

50
00:03:01.042 --> 00:03:02.483
"Sprinkle thistles?"

51
00:03:04.236 --> 00:03:04.496
Loro said.

52
00:03:04.516 --> 00:03:05.137
"What are they?"

53
00:03:05.157 --> 00:03:10.360
"I thought they grew all over Magica but maybe not," Raff said.

54
00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:13.983
"They're a type of thistle that scatters its seeds everywhere.

55
00:03:14.703 --> 00:03:18.026
It's easier for Muncher to eat them than to use magic to get rid of them."

56
00:03:19.307 --> 00:03:21.888
Soon the three kids arrived back at the clearing.

57
00:03:22.729 --> 00:03:24.550
Zella looked over at the wormhole.

58
00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:28.113
"I wonder if Zann got my message moth," she said.

59
00:03:28.133 --> 00:03:32.496
"I still wish I could just pop over to First City and talk to him."

60
00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:34.460
Raff rolled his eyes.

61
00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:40.902
"If you went through that wormhole, Zella, you'd probably end up in Fardark or some other terrible world."

62
00:03:41.822 --> 00:03:43.643
Zella stuck out her tongue at her brother.

63
00:03:43.663 --> 00:03:47.044
"I've heard about Fardark," Loro said.

64
00:03:47.064 --> 00:03:51.505
"It's a world filled with horrible, dangerous creatures, right?"

65
00:03:51.525 --> 00:03:53.846
"Yes," Raff said.

66
00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.386
"Zann's parents went there a few times.

67
00:03:57.327 --> 00:03:58.927
I read about it in one of their books."

68
00:03:59.727 --> 00:04:00.928
Loro cocked his head.

69
00:04:00.948 --> 00:04:02.812
"Wait, Raff.

70
00:04:02.832 --> 00:04:05.333
I thought Zella was the Zann fan, not you!"

71
00:04:06.094 --> 00:04:06.634
He laughed.

72
00:04:09.135 --> 00:04:10.075
Zella laughed too.

73
00:04:10.095 --> 00:04:17.418
"That's true, but Raff has read every book in the village, including my copies of Zann's parents' books.

74
00:04:18.259 --> 00:04:19.259
But never mind that.

75
00:04:19.739 --> 00:04:20.820
Let's go into the cave!"

76
00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:26.182
At the mouth of the cave, Zella and Raff snapped their fingers to create a light.

77
00:04:26.863 --> 00:04:29.804
Loro created one too, and then followed them inside.

78
00:04:30.504 --> 00:04:32.605
The first chamber looked the same as before.

79
00:04:33.305 --> 00:04:34.926
So did the one with the stone table.

80
00:04:35.626 --> 00:04:39.208
The kids started following some tunnels they hadn't explored the previous day.

81
00:04:40.148 --> 00:04:43.970
One tunnel was so narrow that they had to squeeze through sideways.

82
00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.752
Another dropped steeply down, almost like a slide.

83
00:04:48.532 --> 00:04:50.373
The kids had to go down on their rear ends.

84
00:04:51.893 --> 00:04:55.935
"This reminds me of one of Zann's adventures," Zella said when they reached the bottom.

85
00:04:56.856 --> 00:05:00.691
"Remember? He talked about it in that interview we saw on his Directory page.

86
00:05:01.611 --> 00:05:04.774
They slid down a ramp that was hidden under a statue in a park.

87
00:05:05.495 --> 00:05:07.837
The tunnel at the bottom led all the way to the palace!"

88
00:05:08.477 --> 00:05:12.201
Loro was barely listening to Zella as she went on about Zann again.

89
00:05:13.181 --> 00:05:16.124
He'd just spotted something leaning against the cave wall.

90
00:05:16.965 --> 00:05:20.067
It was a long staff with a dusty jewel on the end.

91
00:05:20.087 --> 00:05:22.589
"Oh wow!"

92
00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.352
he thought, his heart pounding with excitement.

93
00:05:26.232 --> 00:05:27.553
"I know what that is!"

94
00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:30.276
Raff and Zella had spotted it too.

95
00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:33.519
"That looks interesting," Raff said.

96
00:05:34.259 --> 00:05:35.500
Zella rushed toward it.

97
00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.203
"Maybe it belonged to old King Zanta!"

98
00:05:38.223 --> 00:05:40.505
"Careful!" Loro blurted out.

99
00:05:40.525 --> 00:05:42.927
"I think you're right, Zella.

100
00:05:43.767 --> 00:05:45.469
That looks like the Sovereign's Staff.

101
00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.772
It's a very powerful ancient relic!"

102
00:05:49.893 --> 00:05:51.894
Zella's eyes widened with awe.

103
00:05:51.914 --> 00:05:58.577
"A relic, like the Mouth of the Undead or the Mask of Zanta or the Dragontamer's Charm?

104
00:05:59.538 --> 00:06:02.881
Like the relics Zann and Perda and the others saw in the Cave of the Unknown?"

105
00:06:03.782 --> 00:06:04.643
Loro nodded.

106
00:06:04.663 --> 00:06:10.348
"Yes. I've heard that the Sovereign's Staff is one of the most powerful relics ever.

107
00:06:11.329 --> 00:06:17.475
If you touch it, it's likely to send you halfway to First City—or something even more dangerous might

108
00:06:17.555 --> 00:06:17.996
happen."
